WEBVTT

00:40:28.954 --> 00:40:32.038
Anything but the natural
incentives to push in

00:40:32.079 --> 00:40:34.496
a direction that we hope will minimize

00:40:34.788 --> 00:40:37.579
the sort of negative unintended
consequences.

00:40:39.121 --> 00:40:40.621
So help me understand this,

00:40:40.621 --> 00:40:46.788
because this is I think this is confusing
to some people. So you started opening.

00:40:46.788 --> 00:40:49.329
I initially I think Elon Musk,
the co-founder,

00:40:49.329 --> 00:40:51.329
and there was a group of you and

00:40:51.329 --> 00:40:55.954
the argument was this technology
is too powerful to be left,

00:40:56.454 --> 00:41:03.788
developed in secret and to be left
developed purely by corporations who have